              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 6:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi lund ubino i Nob bang’ Ahimelek ma jalam: man Ahimelek ubino kara eng’ol Daudi ma kume bemiel, man ewacu ire kumae, Nedi ibino i kendi, man ng’atu moko mbe karacelo kudi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Ahimelek ma jalam kumae, Ubimo ng’olo ira tic, man ewacu ira kumae, Kud iyi ng’atu moko ng’ei gin moko pi tic m’aori i kume, man gin m’ang’olo iri: man ang’olo ni awobi i ka ma nyo, man ka ma nyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno kawono ang’o ni the cingi? mi ira lungu kwen abic i cinga, kadi gin ma tek nuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jalam uloko lembe ni Daudi, ewacu de kumae, Kwen moko ma sai umbe the cinga, ento kwen ma leng’ nuti; ndhu tek awobi gigwokri gigi ni mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi loko lembe ni jalamne, man ewacu ire kumae, Andha jucero iwa mon i ceng’ adek maeni; kan awok woko, nwang’u piny mir awobi maeni gi leng’, kadok en e woth ma thiri thiri; tin piny migi bibedo leng’ ma sagu dit ungo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.5+LEV.24.6+LEV.24.7+LEV.24.8+LEV.24.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 24:5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno jalamne umio ire kwen ma leng’; kum kwen moko mbe keca ndhu kwen m’anyutha, ma jugamu kud i wang’ Yehova, kara juketh kwen ma mor kakare ceng’ ma jukabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u ng’atu moko ma kind jutic pa Saul ni keca i ceng’ maeca, ma jucere i wang’ Yehova; ma nyinge Doeg ma Jaedomi, en e jakwac ma jadit pa Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Ahimelek kumae, Palamularu kadi tong’ moko nuti i beng’i? kum abino ku palamularu para ngo kadi jamcinga de, kum lembe p’ubimo en e ma pio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jalam uwacu kumae, Palamularu pa Goliath ma Jafilisti, m’inego i poga mi Ela e ma nuti, nen, ebedo aboya ku bongu keni i ng’ei ugoke: tek ibigamu maeno, game; kum mange mbe ndhu maeno e ma ni keni. Man Daudi wacu kumae, Moko mbe ma calu maeno, mie ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi ai malu, man eringo i ceng’ maeca ni lworo pa Saul, man ecidho ba Akic m’ubimo mi Gath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.29.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jutic pa Akic giwacu ire kumae, Maeni en e Daudi m’ubimo mi ng’om ungo? giwero pire man ni wadi man ni wadi i miel ungo giwacu kumae,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
